Comment: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:01.02,Comment,,0,0,0,,——Text——
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只要与你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,无论哪里都能去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你在唱什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,With
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,With是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,在英语里是「一起」的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是「一起」的意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道意思就在唱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一起作为歌名吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.87,0:00:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,说到这个  我们也决定一下队伍名吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,队伍名?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那个我已经想过了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.89,0:00:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是胡须猫啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那就这么决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的队伍名就叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,胡须猫海鸥团
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.02,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,把海鸥去了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那就叫胡须猫团
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:00:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,鸥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.71,0:01:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好重
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.63,0:01:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  起床了  鸥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.34,0:01:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要被做色色的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.89,0:01:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不会做啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,食物准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.44,0:02:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,从良一那借来的露营工具也准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.11,0:03:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,鹰原羽依里  听令
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手已经没事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  如你所见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那么寻找海盗船大冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,启程!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  接下来要怎么走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,往那边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就是起点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,看来是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.55,0:03:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是叫with吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这歌我以前好像也听过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.15,0:04:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  我走得太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在铁轨上带着行李箱很不好走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,倒也不至于
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我出发前已经把轮子改成山地轮了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.33,0:04:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是  是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你提吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.87,0:04:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,以前也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前也总是给大家添麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.93,0:04:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我走得很慢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但是别放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢地一边回忆着往事一边走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不也挺好的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:04:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里is好人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,快别这么说了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真的遇到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,笔记上写的向点心时间前进
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.63,0:05:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是向15点的方向吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里你真聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这条线路的尽头会有洞窟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,希望如此吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好热
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要到阴凉的地方休息一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,鸥?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:05:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,鸥!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,鸥!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好热啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真是酷热
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我说  还要走多久呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,鸥同学  请快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我想边走边看风景
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你们先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为这个太重了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你提
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不用  我自己提
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,别啰嗦了  快给我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  快给…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你们先过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想给你们添麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你们先走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.36,0:07:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,鹰原羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你好像在发呆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不是  你跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直跟在你后面啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.63,0:07:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,已经走了好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,还没到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,走了这么久还没找到的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.19,0:07:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.07,0:07:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.01,0:08:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,脚很疼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  不过没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就会恢复了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,从中午开始就开始疼了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.27,0:08:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直不肯让我提箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了用它当拐杖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要瞒着我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,要被做色色的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.51,0:08:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来  羽依里你睡得好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,托你的福
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.09,0:08:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那个  我能问一件事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我虽然也睡得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但是出了好多汗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢  我看那边有个小池塘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我就想稍微去洗个澡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哎奇怪  怎么有水声
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.63,0:09:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.01,0:09:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有什么很大的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.19,0:09:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,确实有…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,巨大的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你说哪里有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在那片的岩石附近
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这里该不会是那家伙喝水的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,在平时喝水的地方看到有你在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.67,0:10:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所以兴奋了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.21,0:10:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,因为看到我所以兴奋…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.09,0:10:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,唉?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,唉?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,别误会  不是在说我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你没看到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你指什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,各种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,骗人的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不想看都难啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看到什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,胸…咳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,莫名其妙发作的胸咳嗽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然现在才这么问有点晚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但走进禁止进入的洞窟会很危险吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但都到这里了  担心也没用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不  担心才正常吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我就算一个人也要去哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的  就知道你会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,和以前一样啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,什么和以前一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.99,0:11:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没事  别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.41,0:11:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么一直往前走就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.92,0:11:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得入口走300米左右
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有一处地方会突然变窄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,穿过这里就是很宽敞的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可以从这里穿过去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那我先过去了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.94,0:11:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,难道说  我曾经来过这里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,现在该往哪边走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.13,0:12:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,再往前一点有条小河
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你的脚…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么问起这个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.61,0:12:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,只是突然想起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,说到底那个行李箱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不就是因为你腿脚不好才提着的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么这样说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我…没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我腿脚不好的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会来这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.21,0:12:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.79,0:12:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为什么要拉着它
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:12:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不告诉你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.34,0:13:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一起探险的伙伴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,探险会伴随着危险
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.26,0:13:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要是有所隐瞒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,会给大家带来麻烦的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然说是大家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也只有你和我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.27,0:13:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,其实…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我从小常常会脚痛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是寒冷天气的早晨和夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.45,0:13:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起这件事瞒着你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起这件事瞒着你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你说住过院
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为生病吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是  平时只是稍微行走不便
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,偶尔会疼到喘不过气
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候还会浑身无力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.89,0:13:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,都这样了还要做这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:14:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉状态还可以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就想着没事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,天一亮就往回走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.99,0:14:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别说傻话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.61,0:14:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样还打算进洞窟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想半途而废
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,反正  都走到这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,往前走往后走都是走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里是为什么来这座小岛的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么突然问起这个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,因为感觉光是我一个人被问
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有点不甘心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过是来疗伤的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说你受伤了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.78,0:14:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,具体呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么非要谈这种个人的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.83,0:14:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我想知道  不准有隐瞒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,真受不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,社团活动搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.65,0:15:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,搞砸什么了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,概括地说就是辜负了大家的期待
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以逃到这里了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,逃…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.12,0:15:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,辜负了期待…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不过能让别人有期待就已经很厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但是落空的时候就会更痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没有达到期待果然很痛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.76,0:15:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我说你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就不能说点好话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.47,0:15:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啦  刚才是在说我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.85,0:16:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不是羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我果然还是有所期待
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然并不是我的本意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但越接近终点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我越发觉到内心的那份期待
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,期待什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我期待遇到大家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,期待海盗船还在这个洞窟的尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定其中的谁已经先到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.21,0:16:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里在等我…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我这样期待着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但是说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.34,0:16:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我也清楚那里大概没有人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我从小身体不好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在医院里度过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,几乎没有暑假出去玩的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所以对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.56,0:16:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那次的回忆是很珍贵的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.78,0:16:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但我明白对其他人可能并非如此
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那个夏天只是大家无数回忆中的一角
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,被埋没  被忘却
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可是  对我来说那是独一无二的宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,所以只有我才会这么执着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多该出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.89,0:17:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,手电筒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没…没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.11,0:17:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上换电池
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,鸥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,鸥!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:17:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.05,0:18:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的  目的地应该快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,只要与你在一起  无论哪儿都能去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.87,0:18:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里都不去也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.04,0:18:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只要与你在一起  就能走遍世界各地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不走也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.43,0:18:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哪儿都能去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是出口
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.19,0:18:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,到外面了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有海的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里  你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,被淹死可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是游泳部的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次听说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说在游泳部辜负了大家的期待吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.14,0:19:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,现在别提那个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.35,0:19:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,另外  要是我说错了的话先道个歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我醒来之前
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有人在亲我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说  你帮我做了人工呼吸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,人命关天
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不用害羞的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,人·命·关·天
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里  快看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.01,0:20:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那边能看到光
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.93,0:20:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,脚很疼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.47,0:20:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.56,0:20:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,行李箱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,掉进水里时被冲走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.73,0:20:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,扶着我的肩膀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.31,0:20:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就差一点点  我想自己走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但是慢慢走就好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,继续刚才的话题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.37,0:20:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就是关于大家会不会忘掉回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能太高估暑假了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.71,0:20:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你拥有的那种美好回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.47,0:20:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是不是那么容易就能创造的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.30,0:20:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,比如为了找到海盗船
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.89,0:20:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在小岛上探险之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.14,0:20:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我已经不是小孩了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在我还是心情澎湃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:20:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里不会忘掉今天的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不会忘吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.11,0:21:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该会永远记得
Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Comment,,0,0,0,,
